OL,3,GNEWSA'All-day' alcohol plan at new
OL,4,Amarket provokes row
OL,5,
OL,6,FA row has broken out over plans to sell
OL,7,Falcohol at a market between 08:00 and
OL,8,F23:00 daily.
OL,10,FCity of Wolverhampton Council applied
OL,11,Fto change its licence for the newly
OL,12,Frevamped Bilston Market, but two
OL,13,Fcouncillors raised objections to the
OL,14,Fproposed changes.
OL,16,FIn its application, the council said
OL,17,Fall events at the market would be
OL,18,Fsubject to appropriate risk
OL,19,Fassessments, which are aimed at dealing
OL,20,Fwith noise, crowd control and litter.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
